{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲说清了“相伴带来满足→开始想让亲近延续→发现对方心意不能由自己决定→急切无处落实→舒适中出现牵制”的主因果链，但把第20–22小节的突发急切、思绪碎裂和流动滞留收束成“放不下已经生出的需要”，没有细说身体如何先于念头反应、尝试确认如何反过来加重阻滞。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙分别解释了安静余韵为何能够成立、舍不得如何先以身体冲动冒头又因无法确认对方心意而退回，以及反复卡在未解问题上如何使思绪碎裂、流动受阻，同时保留亲近的温柔；相对薄弱之处是“前段期待持续而未受伤”和“时间流逝使珍惜加深”等心理前提比听感记录本身更具体，属于合理但尚不能单凭这段音乐坐实的诠释。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙不仅保留了甲关于亲近需求受制于对方心意的核心解释，还进一步说明了段内转折、身体先于明确念头的反应，以及越想确认越发现无法立即获得答案、从而反过来加重停滞的机制，新增的推断虽需保留余地，但不足以构成实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c8cbef4f-560f-4e74-8c1e-3c6373783016", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140608821389Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.5, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:07:19.334692+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "de2de1fc997f9a169b256fc2f21b66d976295d16bfabbc5fbd0873451e199340", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f